<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Simsmetal boosts equity in UK unit.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Simsmetal boosts equity in UK unit.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian metal recycler Simsmetal Ltd said on Monday it would increase equity in its British subsidiary Simsmetal UK Ltd by A$30 million in order to assist further market growth and acquisitions.</p>
<p>The company also said a subsidiary of Simsmetal UK, Sims McIntyre Recyclers, had acquired the assets and business of Lincoln Ferrous Metals Ltd and Lincolnshire Metals Ltd.</p>
<p>These relatively small acquisitions will strengthen Sims McIntyre's market position in the northeast Midlands of England, it said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
